                                "sense_id": "d826a5be-83c7-35b9-92a3-b85e5e472352",
                                "text": "But the idea that Singapore is a deregulated paradise is not borne out by reality, as anyone who has tried to dispose of a piece of used chewing gum there will know."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7862fe5f-5ebb-47fb-b8c8-36bd1fd8fddd",
                                "sense_id": "d826a5be-83c7-35b9-92a3-b85e5e472352",
                                "text": "\"We're still in a deregulated market, so operators identify routes that they deem profitable. Cornwall Council fills in the gaps and provides socially necessary services, contracting those as part of whole network planning."
                            }
                        ]
